		min-width: 48px;
		padding: 0.625rem 1.25rem;
		border-radius: 0.5rem;
		background-color: #F97316;
		border: none;
		color: #FFFFFF;
		font-size: 0.875rem;
		font-weight: 700;
		cursor: pointer;
		box-shadow: 0 2px 4px rgba(249, 115, 22, 0.25);
